- Parse `PARSE_RATE_STATUS=OK` from stdout. Exit code is always 0; branch on the KV line.
  - `OK` → voter is effective (add to `EFFECTIVE_VOTER_FILES`).
  - Non-OK → increment `VOTER_PARSE_FAILED_COUNT` and exclude.
- Note: the `--ballot-file`, `--id-grammar`, and `--review-tmpdir` values must be confirmed to be in scope at the point of the voter-eligibility loop. Read the script before editing.
- Do not change `voting.py` behavior.

